    narr:generatedFrom "ce834cb9455a1a2763cbc8a410109d52b6381eaa" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative holds a settled ruling on reaction delivery, re-recorded across three passes. [The framing of where reaction delivery belongs](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_1) grounds [the directive that every reaction routes through one bundle per run per person, not one message per skill](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2). The ruling was held under pressure — [Tina's pushback on the batching window, answered by the rule that a bundle closes when the run closes and a late skill waits for the next run](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_3). [The rejected alternative of per-skill delivery with client-side collapsing](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_4) is recorded with [the same rejection rationale stated separately](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5). Earlier passes re-record the same arc — [the framing](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_1), [the directive](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2), [the pushback exchange](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3), and [the rejected alternative](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_4) — and a second pass repeats it as [framing](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_1), [directive](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_2), [pushback](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_3), and [alternative](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_4). The whole arc supports [the position on where bundling and batching windows should be bounded](narr:Position_ReactionDeliveryBundlingAndBatchingBoundary).""" ;
    narr:reaction """A third pass of the same ruling arc has landed, so the arc is now recorded three times — [the newest pass](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2) repeats [the directive](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2) and [the pushback exchange](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3) verbatim rather than revising them. Nothing in the ruling moved; what changed is durability — the position is now witnessed across three recording dates, which firms the arc's support for [the boundary position](narr:Position_ReactionDeliveryBundlingAndBatchingBoundary) without altering its content.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ReactionDeliveryBundlingAndBatchingBoundary> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "we route every reaction through one bundle per run per person, not one\n> message per skill — a person should get one thing to read, not four" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Tina pushed back on the batching window and Tanya held: the bundle closes when\nthe run closes, and a skill that misses the close waits for the next run rather\nthan sending on its own." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The alternative considered and rejected was per-skill\ndelivery with client-side collapsing, which moves the ordering problem onto the\nreader." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Tanya (team owner) ruled on where reaction delivery belongs:" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_1> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The rejected alternative — per-skill delivery with client-side collapsing — remains recorded as the road not taken, on the rationale that it moves the ordering problem onto the reader." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_4> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Tina's pushback on the batching window is the live dissent within the arc; the ruling held, but the challenge is preserved rather than erased." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_3> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3> ] ;
